  "visualBrief": "Individual medium-fi Old Town Saint Nicholas: pale south Baroque front with paired columns,arched/oval fields,curved crown and abstract sculpture;two mapped square towers with green bell/onion crowns and genuinely open upper lanterns;central octagonal pale drum,two-tier green bell roof and smaller white lantern;red tile side roofs,east rounded apse and west secondary portal/curved steps. Five existing shared256² graphs plus local glazing/gold accents,seven groups and four browser LODs. Exact map controls retained;fine architecture and ground joins approximate.",
